{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for TrustRide', 'description': 'Primary container for TrustRide implementation: RideCircle is a secure, institution-verified ride-pooling app designed for students and professionals. It ensures only users from recognized institutions or organizations can join, providing a trusted environment for sharing rides. The app emphasizes user safety, eco-friendliness, and community trust through features like real-time guardian tracking, emergency tools, and eco impact tracking.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Verified Institutional Login",\n      "description": "Users can only sign up and log in using their institution or company email, verified by domain. Optional biometric login for added security.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Ride Discovery & Pooling",\n      "description": "Browse and filter available ride pools by time, institution, and gender preference. View ride details, seat availability, and book or request rides.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Trust & Safety Dashboard",\n      "description": "Includes Buddy Tracker for real-time ride sharing with guardians, an emergency SOS button, and a Trust Index showing ratings, behavior flags, and punctuality.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Eco Score Tracker",\n      "description": "Displays carbon footprint saved, ride history with eco impact, and a leaderboard for top eco-savers within each institution or company.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Profile & Settings",\n      "description": "Shows verified ID tag, completed rides, ratings, and allows management of notification preferences, guardian contacts, and emergency setup.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#0077B6",\n    "secondary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "accent": "#00A896"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a minimalist, modern UI with a calm blue, white, and green color palette. Rounded cards, soft shadows, and intuitive icons are used throughout. The main navigation is via a bottom tab bar: Home (Ride Discovery), Eco Score, Trust & Safety, and Profile. Each screen uses clean sans-serif fonts and clear sectioning. The Welcome/Login screen features the RideCircle logo and tagline. Ride details and booking use card layouts with prominent verification and safety indicators. The Trust & Safety dashboard and Eco Score screens use visual indicators and leaderboards for engagement."\n}'}",
